Problem 1
==================================================

(12xxx + 22xx + 5x - 5)  /  (3x + 4)

---

divisor: (3x + 4)


12xxx/3x = 4xx

4xx(3x + 4) = 16xx + 12xxx

(12xxx + 22xx + 5x - 5) - (12xxx + 16xx)

quotient: 4xx
expression: 6xx + 5x - 5


6xx/3x = 2x

2x(3x + 4) = 6xx + 8x

(6xx + 5x - 5) - (6xx + 8x)

quotient: 4xx + 2x
expression: -3x - 5


-3x/3x = -1
-(3x + 4) = -3x - 4

(-3x - 5)  -  (-3x - 4)

quotient: 4xx + 2x - 1
expression: -1

DONE

quotient: 4xx + 2x - 1
remainder: -1

